Z||000015||Raydar||03-27-2000||12:22 PM||||A lot of tire shops (won't mention any names, but their initials are N,T, and B) don't like to put anything on the car other than what the book specifies. They're afraid of being sued if something goes wrong. I used to have a Firebird Formula with Z rated tires (never mind that it was only a 5.0 TBI) and they really had heartburn about installing anything other than Z or H rated tires. ||||reg||1
